Print build info from an OTA without extracting

Usage: android-doctor info [OPTIONS] <INPUT>

Arguments:
  <INPUT>  

Options:
      --json      Print all metadata as JSON
      --no-color  Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
      --details   Also summarise the updater-script and read the signing certificate
  -h, --help      Print help
